    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - This instantly appealing SOUTH-WEST FACING 3 bed end of terrace home with side access is conveniently located off the ring road / The crescent, adjacent to a large green perfect for family living. The property has been well maintained over the years enjoying spacious light-filled well proportioned accommodation sure to please all who view. ready for immediate occupation with the added benefit of NO ONWARD CHAIN. Millbrook is a highly sought after and mature residential area, conveniently located just in off the N81, Via the Old Bawn Road or Seskin View Road within a pleasant stroll of Dodder Valley Park, public transport, the link footbridge to Firhouse, local convenience stores, Church, schools etc., all of which facilitate family living. The M50 is nearby providing ease of access to various routes. Early viewing highly recommended to avoid disappointment. REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway with wood flooring, walk in under stairs storage plus separate shelved storage press\r\nLounge : 3.13m x 4.59m feature brick fireplace with external chimney, wood flooring, open plan to the dining area.\r\nKitchen/dining room : 2.80m x 5.01m Neat arrangement of Shaker style built in units and presses, stainless steel extractor hood, hob and oven, tiled splash area, wood flooring, door off to the rear garden\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBathroom : 1.44m x 2.40m Shower cubicle with Mira shower - wc -pedestal whb - The floor and wall areas are fully tiled\r\nHot press new immersion boiler\r\nBedroom 1 : 3.10m x 3.45m wood flooring\r\nBedroom 2 : 3.10m x 4.70m wood flooring \r\nBedroom 3 : 3.84m x 2.49m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Solid Fuel central heating / New immersion boiler (Gas is in the area)\r\nPart Pvc part aluminium double glazing\r\nModern kitchen/ divider counter\r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\nWood flooring practically throughout\r\nFully tiled bathroom\r\nWalled private garden to the front with off street parking\r\nExcellent side entrance to the green from the rear garden \r\nWalled rear garden, neatly manicured, concrete patio area perfect for relaxing or entertaining\r\nBER No 112936190"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
